  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labour Inspection project Qatar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to support the capacity building of 5 key policy makers/teamleaders from the Qatari Ministry of Administrative Development, Labour and Social Affairs (MADLSA) in the field of labour inspection, with the aim to contribute to the improvement of labour conditions for migrant workers in Qatar. This project is therefore foreseen to contribute to the implementation of the technical cooperation project 2018 &#x2013; 2020 between the International Labour Organisation (ILO) and Qatar.</narrative>
  </description>
